      "content": "i get the \"balance\" thing but honestly that feels like a cop-out when im the one who has to present to a crowd that's already split. like, if you HAD to pick one as the fundamental foundation for a healthy society, which one serves the kids better in the long run? is it better to build their confidence in the country first, or is it more important that they learn to spot inequality from a young age?",
